  <jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6&gt;（税効果会計関係）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; line-height: 14.4px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;１．繰延税金資産及び繰延税金負債の発生の主な原因別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;
